<section class="bg-cream-50 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 text-center sm:px-8">
    <p class="eyebrow text-teal-700">The moment that matters</p>
    <h2 class="mt-5 font-heading text-[clamp(2rem,4.4vw,3.2rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-ink-900 text-balance">
      The sixty seconds after treatment decide the next twelve months.
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
      The patient is relieved and grateful, and they will follow whatever you hand them next. Hand them a printed sheet and it goes in the bin. Hand them a plan in your own app and they open it every day, earn points for sticking to it, and tell their friends where they got it.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-cream-300 bg-cream-300 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-cream-50 p-7">
        <p class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold text-teal-700">88%</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-600">average aftercare adherence when the plan lives in the patient app</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-cream-50 p-7">
        <p class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold text-teal-700">2.3x</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-600">more likely a referred patient stays with the practice long term</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-cream-50 p-7">
        <p class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold text-teal-700">4x</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-600">more reviews when the ask happens at the moment of aftercare</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
